<channel version="26.6.0">
  <id>00000037-0000-0000-0000-000000000037</id>
  <nextMetaDataId>4</nextMetaDataId>
  <name>SMTP CC/BCC Test Channel</name>
  <description>NET-10 / SC-1+SC-5 (18.5-03): Channel Reader (REST-pumped) source + three SMTP Sender destinations sharing the dedicated GreenMail stub on SMTP_CCBCC_PORT. Destination 1 proves single-recipient CC-in-headers / BCC-blind delivery (B1); Destination 2 proves the same property for comma-separated multi-recipient CC/BCC lists (B2); Destination 3 characterizes the un-trimmed whitespace-after-comma edge (B5, D-04 -- record, do not fix). Distinct-domain throwaway mailboxes (to.smoke.test/from.smoke.test/cc.smoke.test/bcc.smoke.test/ws.smoke.test) keep per-recipient assertions distinguishable on the shared stub. Test-only; never deploy to production.</description>
